OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMorning fog patches soon
OL,6,Fclearing to leave a fine day, with
OL,7,Fplenty of sunny spells. Perhaps some
OL,8,Fcloudier moments in the east later in
OL,9,Fthe afternoon. Feeling pleasantly warm
OL,10,Fin the sunshine, with an easterly
OL,11,Fbreeze developing.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA fine evening for all, then
OL,14,Fdry overnight with lengthy clear
OL,15,Fspells. Breezy over the hills. Not
OL,16,Fquite as chilly as recent nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
