OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FStaying dry through the
OL,6,Fmorning, with spells of warm sunshine.
OL,7,FThe chance of a few showers drifting
OL,8,Fin from the south by the afternoon,
OL,9,Fpotentially heavy later. Turning
OL,10,Fincreasingly humid.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FLow
OL,13,Fpressure moving in from the southwest
OL,14,Fwill bring an unsettled period, with
OL,15,Fheavy downpours and thunderstorms
OL,16,Flikely each day. Turning increasingly
OL,17,Fhumid, with temperatures staying a
OL,18,Flittle above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
